#. TRANSLATORS: MDX-derived text from packages/learn/tutorial.mdx
msgid "With all these examples you might find it helpful to use the <b>Hex Monitor</b> in the debug view to watch the memory change. Pick a memory region from the list to see that section — for example, <b>Display Memory ($0200–$05FF)</b> to watch the screen pixels, or <b>Zero Page ($0000–$00FF)</b> to inspect the first 256 bytes."
